  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v12 (breaking): Removed all members previously marked [Obsolete] — StatusMessage, StatusCode, ResultData, and every HttpStatusCode-based constructor across OperationResult/OperationDataResult/SuccessResult/SuccessDataResult/ErrorResult/ErrorDataResult. Use Title/Status/Data and the ResultStatus-based constructors instead (see README \"Migrating to v12\"). Also includes the previously-unreleased v11.1 additions: Result.Combine, Ensure/EnsureAsync guard clauses, and Task-aware async composition helpers (MatchAsync/OnSuccessAsync/OnFailureAsync/MapAsync/BindAsync). See CHANGELOG.md for details.",
